{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06365","headline":"崔五宅送刘跂入京 · 李颀","name":"崔五宅送刘跂入京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行人惜寸景，系马暂留欢。\n昨日辞小沛，何时到长安。\n乡中饮酒礼，客里行路难。\n清洛云鸿度，故关风日寒。\n维将道可乐，不念身无官。\n生事东山远，田园芳岁阑。\n东归余谢病，西去子加餐。\n宋伯非徒尔，明时正可干。\n躬耕守贫贱，失计在林端。\n宿昔奉颜色，慙无双玉盘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06365.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06365","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}